---
import { Image } from 'astro:assets'
import portraitSrc from '../../Assets/Danial_photo.webp'
import { social } from '../data/site.ts'
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro'
---

<Layout
  title="About — Danial Rashidi"
  description="About Danial Rashidi — Computer Engineering student and software/product builder from Iran, working across Web, AI, Automation and Product Engineering. Building Noveno, improving foundations, and using AI as leverage with verification."
>
  <!-- Hero -->
  <section class="about-hero">
    <div class="container about-hero__inner">
      <div class="about-hero__label">
        <span class="about-hero__eyebrow">About</span>
        <span class="about-hero__rule" aria-hidden="true"></span>
        <span class="about-hero__meta">Iran · Student · Builder</span>
      </div>

      <div class="about-hero__grid">
        <div class="about-hero__text">
          <h1 class="about-hero__title">Danial Rashidi</h1>
          <p class="about-hero__role">Computer Engineering student and software&nbsp;&amp; product builder.</p>
          <p class="about-hero__lede">
            I build practical software — web products, AI-assisted systems and automations — from vague idea to working implementation. I am interested in software, AI, products and entrepreneurship, and in turning ambiguity into something a person can actually use.
          </p>
        </div>

        <div class="about-hero__media">
          <figure class="about-hero__figure">
            <Image
              src={portraitSrc}
              alt="Portrait of Danial Rashidi"
              widths={[320, 480, 640]}
              sizes="(max-width: 820px) 100vw, 360px"
              loading="eager"
              fetchpriority="high"
              decoding="async"
              class="about-hero__portrait"
            />
            <figcaption class="about-hero__caption">
              <span class="about-hero__captionName">Danial Rashidi</span>
              <span class="about-hero__captionMeta">Software & Product Builder · Iran</span>
            </figcaption>
          </figure>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- Body -->
  <section class="about-body">
    <div class="container about-body__inner">
      <div class="about-body__grid">
        <div class="about-body__main">
          <section class="about-section" aria-labelledby="background-title">
            <h2 id="background-title" class="about-section__title">Background</h2>
            <div class="about-section__prose">
              <p>
                I am from Iran and study Computer Engineering. The path into product and software building was not a title change — it was a gradual move from writing code to owning the problem itself: what is being built, for whom, with what trade-offs, and how it stays maintainable.
              </p>
              <p>
                I work across <strong>software products</strong>, <strong>web</strong>, <strong>AI-assisted software development</strong>, <strong>automation</strong> and <strong>practical product engineering</strong>. Most of the work I value lives at the intersection of engineering discipline and product judgment — not demo depth, but systems that survive real use.
              </p>
              <p>
                The interest in AI, products and entrepreneurship is connected: each is leverage for the other. I explore practical automation and agent-assisted workflows specifically where they reduce repetitive work or clarify a business path, not as a style.
              </p>
            </div>
          </section>

          <section class="about-section" aria-labelledby="how-title">
            <h2 id="how-title" class="about-section__title">How I work</h2>
            <div class="about-section__prose">
              <p>
                I prefer calm, precise systems over noisy ones. A product is valuable when it becomes usable — the earlier it is runnable, the earlier it can be tested against reality. That means small releases, honest unknowns, and explicit responsibility for verification.
              </p>
              <p>
                AI is part of the workflow — implementation, research, debugging, repetitive tasks and iteration go faster with it. But requirements, architecture, verification, testing and the final decision stay human. AI coding tools are leverage that must not replace verification or judgment. Nothing is presented as reviewed because a model approved it.
              </p>
            </div>
            <ul class="about-principles" role="list">
              <li class="about-principles__item">
                <span class="about-principles__num">01</span>
                <span class="about-principles__text"><strong>Solve the actual problem</strong> — avoid complexity that does not improve the outcome.</span>
              </li>
              <li class="about-principles__item">
                <span class="about-principles__num">02</span>
                <span class="about-principles__text"><strong>Ship working systems</strong> — ideas become valuable when they become usable.</span>
              </li>
              <li class="about-principles__item">
                <span class="about-principles__num">03</span>
                <span class="about-principles__text"><strong>Use AI as leverage</strong> — faster implementation should not mean weaker verification.</span>
              </li>
              <li class="about-principles__item">
                <span class="about-principles__num">04</span>
                <span class="about-principles__text"><strong>Keep systems understandable</strong> — readable, testable systems are easier to maintain and improve.</span>
              </li>
            </ul>
          </section>

          <section class="about-section" aria-labelledby="direction-title">
            <h2 id="direction-title" class="about-section__title">Direction</h2>
            <div class="about-section__prose">
              <p>
                The current direction is specific: become a stronger product engineer, build useful software, improve engineering foundations, and build <a href={social.noveno} target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Noveno</a> incrementally. Not a broad aspiration list — a few things done well and repeatedly, with evidence.
              </p>
              <p>
                The longer aim is practical: more working products, better foundations in TypeScript, backend and product engineering, and systems that stay honest under real constraints — mobile, unstable network, limited tools.
              </p>
            </div>
          </section>

          <section class="about-section about-section--beyond" aria-labelledby="beyond-title">
            <h2 id="beyond-title" class="about-section__title">Beyond software</h2>
            <div class="about-section__prose">
              <p>
                Outside work I stay active — bodybuilding, the mountains, camping — and care about travel, music and exploring how technology and the near future evolve. Those interests keep the work grounded: life outside the editor is not separate from judgment inside it.
              </p>
            </div>
          </section>
        </div>

        <aside class="about-aside" aria-label="At a glance">
          <div class="about-card">
            <div class="about-card__label">Focus</div>
            <ul class="about-card__list" role="list">
              <li>Software products</li>
              <li>Web</li>
              <li>AI-assisted development</li>
              <li>Automation</li>
              <li>Product Engineering</li>
            </ul>
          </div>

          <div class="about-card">
            <div class="about-card__label">Currently</div>
            <ul class="about-card__list" role="list">
              <li>Strengthening engineering foundations (TypeScript / backend / product)</li>
              <li>Building Noveno — customer acquisition system</li>
              <li>Shipping Fast English increments</li>
            </ul>
          </div>

          <div class="about-card">
            <div class="about-card__label">Elsewhere</div>
            <div class="about-card__links">
              <a href={social.github} target="_blank" rel="me noopener noreferrer">GitHub</a>
              <a href={social.x} target="_blank" rel="me noopener noreferrer">X {social.xHandle}</a>
              <a href={`mailto:${social.email}`}>{social.email}</a>
              <a href={social.noveno} target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">{social.noveno.replace("https://", "")} ↗</a>
            </div>
          </div>

          <a href="/contact" class="about-aside__cta">Get in touch <span aria-hidden="true">→</span></a>
          <p class="about-aside__note">No form, no tracker — direct contact. The fastest reply is email.</p>
        </aside>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>
</Layout>

<style>
  /* — Hero — */
  .about-hero {
    padding: clamp(1.75rem, 5vw, 2.75rem) 0 clamp(1.5rem, 4vw, 2rem);
    border-bottom: var(--border-hairline);
    background:
      linear-gradient(180deg, color-mix(in srgb, var(--color-accent-soft) 30%, transparent) 0%, transparent 58%),
      radial-gradient(ellipse at 76% 0%, color-mix(in srgb, var(--color-border) 16%, transparent) 0%, transparent 52%);
    position: relative;
    overflow: clip;
  }

  .about-hero::before {
    content: "";
    position: absolute;
    top: 0; left: 0; right: 0;
    height: 1px;
    background: linear-gradient(90deg, var(--color-accent) 0%, transparent 42%);
    opacity: 0.5;
  }

  .about-hero__inner {
    position: relative;
    max-width: var(--width-content);
  }

  .about-hero__label {
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: var(--space-3);
    font-family: var(--font-mono);
    font-size: 11px;
    letter-spacing: 0.1em;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    font-weight: 700;
    color: var(--color-text-faint);
  }

  .about-hero__eyebrow {
    color: var(--color-text);
  }

  .about-hero__rule {
    width: 28px;
    height: 1px;
    background: var(--color-border-strong);
    opacity: 0.7;
  }

  .about-hero__meta {
    font-weight: 600;
    color: var(--color-text-faint);
  }

  .about-hero__grid {
    margin-top: var(--space-6);
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: 1.2fr 0.8fr;
    gap: clamp(1.5rem, 4vw, 3rem);
    align-items: center;
  }

  .about-hero__title {
    font-size: clamp(2rem, 5vw, 3rem);
    line-height: 0.92;
    letter-spacing: -0.032em;
    font-weight: 680;
  }

  .about-hero__role {
    margin-top: var(--space-3);
    font-family: var(--font-mono);
    font-size: 11px;
    letter-spacing: 0.08em;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    font-weight: 600;
    color: var(--color-text-faint);
  }

  .about-hero__lede {
    margin-top: var(--space-4);
    font-size: clamp(1.02rem, 1.9vw, 1.15rem);
    line-height: 1.65;
    color: var(--color-text-muted);
    max-width: 52ch;
  }

  .about-hero__figure {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    align-items: center;
    gap: var(--space-3);
    max-width: 360px;
    margin-inline: auto;
  }

  .about-hero__portrait {
    width: 100%;
    height: auto;
    aspect-ratio: 1 / 1;
    object-fit: cover;
    border-radius: var(--radius-xl);
    border: var(--border-hairline);
    box-shadow: var(--shadow-sm);
    display: block;
  }

  .about-hero__caption {
    text-align: center;
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 2px;
  }

  .about-hero__captionName {
    font-size: var(--text-sm);
    font-weight: 600;
    letter-spacing: -0.01em;
    color: var(--color-text);
  }

  .about-hero__captionMeta {
    font-family: var(--font-mono);
    font-size: 11px;
    letter-spacing: 0.06em;
    color: var(--color-text-faint);
  }

  @media (max-width: 820px) {
    .about-hero__grid {
      grid-template-columns: 1fr;
    }
    .about-hero__figure { max-width: 420px; }
    .about-hero__portrait { aspect-ratio: 4 / 3; object-position: center 26%; }
  }

  @media (max-width: 480px) {
    .about-hero__figure { max-width: 100%; }
  }

  /* — Body — */
  .about-body {
    padding: clamp(1.5rem, 4vw, 2.5rem) 0 clamp(2.5rem, 6vw, 4rem);
  }

  .about-body__inner {
    max-width: var(--width-content);
  }

  .about-body__grid {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: 1.58fr 0.82fr;
    gap: clamp(1.5rem, 4vw, 3rem);
    align-items: start;
  }

  .about-section + .about-section {
    margin-top: clamp(1.5rem, 4vw, 2.25rem);
    padding-top: clamp(1.5rem, 4vw, 2rem);
    border-top: var(--border-hairline);
  }

  .about-section--beyond {
    background: var(--color-surface-raised);
    border: var(--border-hairline);
    border-radius: var(--radius-lg);
    padding: var(--space-5) var(--space-6);
    margin-top: clamp(1.5rem, 4vw, 2.25rem);
  }

  .about-section--beyond .about-section__title {
    font-size: var(--text-lg);
  }

  .about-section__title {
    font-size: clamp(1.2rem, 2.2vw, 1.45rem);
    line-height: 1.15;
    letter-spacing: -0.02em;
    font-weight: 650;
  }

  .about-section__prose {
    margin-top: var(--space-4);
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: var(--space-4);
    max-width: 60ch;
  }

  .about-section__prose p {
    font-size: var(--text-md);
    line-height: 1.75;
    color: var(--color-text-muted);
  }

  .about-section__prose a {
    color: var(--color-accent);
    text-decoration: underline;
    text-decoration-color: color-mix(in srgb, var(--color-accent) 28%, transparent);
    text-underline-offset: 3px;
  }
  .about-section__prose a:hover { color: var(--color-accent-hover); text-decoration-color: var(--color-accent); }
  .about-section__prose strong { color: var(--color-text); font-weight: 600; }

  .about-principles {
    margin-top: var(--space-5);
    list-style: none;
    padding: 0;
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr;
    gap: var(--space-3) var(--space-4);
    max-width: 60ch;
  }

  .about-principles__item {
    display: flex;
    gap: var(--space-3);
    align-items: flex-start;
    padding: var(--space-3);
    background: var(--color-surface);
    border: var(--border-hairline);
    border-radius: var(--radius-md);
  }

  .about-principles__num {
    font-family: var(--font-mono);
    font-size: 10px;
    font-weight: 700;
    letter-spacing: 0.08em;
    color: var(--color-accent);
    background: var(--color-accent-soft);
    border: 1px solid color-mix(in srgb, var(--color-accent) 14%, transparent);
    width: 22px;
    height: 22px;
    display: inline-flex;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: center;
    border-radius: 50%;
    flex-shrink: 0;
    margin-top: 2px;
  }

  .about-principles__text {
    font-size: var(--text-sm);
    line-height: 1.6;
    color: var(--color-text-muted);
  }
  .about-principles__text strong { color: var(--color-text); }

  @media (max-width: 720px) {
    .about-principles { grid-template-columns: 1fr; }
  }

  /* — Aside — */
  .about-aside {
    position: sticky;
    top: 84px;
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: var(--space-4);
  }

  .about-card {
    padding: var(--space-5);
    background: var(--color-surface);
    border: var(--border-hairline);
    border-radius: var(--radius-md);
  }

  .about-card__label {
    font-family: var(--font-mono);
    font-size: 11px;
    letter-spacing: 0.1em;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    font-weight: 700;
    color: var(--color-text-faint);
  }

  .about-card__list {
    margin-top: var(--space-3);
    list-style: none;
    padding: 0;
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: var(--space-2);
    font-size: var(--text-sm);
    line-height: 1.6;
    color: var(--color-text-muted);
  }

  .about-card__links {
    margin-top: var(--space-3);
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: var(--space-2);
  }

  .about-card__links a {
    font-size: var(--text-sm);
    font-weight: 500;
    color: var(--color-text-muted);
    overflow-wrap: anywhere;
  }
  .about-card__links a:hover { color: var(--color-accent); }

  .about-aside__cta {
    display: inline-flex;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: center;
    gap: 6px;
    padding: 10px 16px;
    border-radius: var(--radius-pill);
    background: var(--color-text);
    color: var(--color-canvas);
    font-size: var(--text-sm);
    font-weight: 600;
    transition: transform var(--duration-fast) var(--ease-default), background var(--duration-fast) var(--ease-default);
  }
  .about-aside__cta:hover {
    background: color-mix(in srgb, var(--color-text) 88%, var(--color-accent));
    transform: translateY(-1px);
  }

  .about-aside__note {
    font-family: var(--font-mono);
    font-size: 11px;
    line-height: 1.6;
    color: var(--color-text-faint);
    border-left: 2px solid var(--color-border);
    padding-left: 10px;
  }

  @media (max-width: 820px) {
    .about-body__grid { grid-template-columns: 1fr; }
    .about-aside { position: static; }
  }
</style>
